rface":"衞人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、並稱、匿名者、校勘或尚未定指代；不補姓名、親屬、闕代或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m038-0054","start":54,"end":58,"surface":"公子斑師","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001597","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m038-0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"斑師","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001597","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-037-wei:m038-0072","start":72,"end":75,"surface":"公子起","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001598","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-037-wei","book_id":"b-shiji-037","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-037-wei"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p128","text":"十四年，頃公卒，子定公午立。定公十一年，魯陽虎奔晉，趙鞅簡子捨之。十二年，孔子相魯。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m128-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"頃公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001817","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m128-0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"定公午","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000269","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m128-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"定公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000269","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m128-0020","start":20,"end":23,"surface":"魯陽虎","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001180","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m128-0026","start":26,"end":30,"surface":"趙鞅簡子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000429","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m128-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000056","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p129","text":"十五年，趙鞅使邯鄲大夫午，不信，欲殺午，午與中行寅、范吉射親攻趙鞅，鞅走保晉陽。定公圍晉陽。荀櫟、韓不信、魏侈與范、中行爲仇，乃移兵伐范、中行。范、中行反，晉君撃之，敗范、中行。范、中行走朝歌，保之。韓、魏爲趙鞅謝晉君，乃赦趙鞅，復位。二十二年，晉敗范、中行氏，二子奔齊。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m129-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"趙鞅","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000429","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m129-0007","start":7,"end":12,"surface":"邯鄲大夫午","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001818","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m129-0018","start":18,"end":19,"surface":"午","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001818","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m129-0020","start":20,"end":21,"surface":"午","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001818","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m129-0022","start":22,"end":25,"surface":"中行寅","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001819","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m129-0026","start":26,"end":29,"surface":"范吉射","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001820","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m129-0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"趙鞅","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000429","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m129-0034","start":34,"end":35,"surface":"鞅","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000429","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m129-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"定公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000269","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m129-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"荀櫟","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001821","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m129-0049","start":49,"end":52,"surface":"韓不信","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001822","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m129-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"魏侈","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001823","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m129-0056","start":56,"end":60,"surface":"范、中行","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或未定指代；不補未見